135ws76hzus1zh5hriv.jpeg&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;  &lt;img src=&quot;https://bucket-api.fengimg.com/feng-bbs-att/2025/02/26/102135bcrzppbyh4jmsc6e.jpeg&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;  &lt;img src=&quot;https://bucket-api.fengimg.com/feng-bbs-att/2025/02/26/102135eiasfems8i4dx9sb.jpeg&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;  </description><link>https://www.feng.com/post/13883523</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.feng.com/post/13883523</guid><pubDate>Wed, 26 Feb 2025 02:21:54 GMT</pubDate><author>gingor</author></item><item><title>20250224壁纸二</title><description>不喜勿喷 &lt;br&gt;  &lt;img src=&quot;https://bucket-api.fengimg.com/feng-bbs-att/2025/02/24/0920456qnb81q9t0brf4b9.jpeg&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;  &lt;img src=&quot;https://bucket-api.fengimg.com/feng-bbs-att/2025/02/24/092049429uox01wkqax3bk.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;  </description><link>https://www.feng.com/post/13883177</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.feng.com/post/13883177</guid><pubDate>Mon, 24 Feb 2025 01:20:54 GMT</pubDate><author>shuanghui888</author></item><item><title>XR换电池，求推荐</title><description>&lt;p&gt;XR的电池不行了，想自己换一块，网上各种电池50-100多不等，尤其有说是原厂拆机的，循环100次以下，要100多块！买什么样的靠谱，有没有大神推荐一下！&lt;/p&gt;</description><link>https://www.feng.com/post/13881720</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.feng.com/post/13881720</guid><pubDate>Sat, 15 Feb 2025 07:04:33 GMT</pubDate><author>liupeng0621</author></item><item><title>20250213壁纸三</title><description>不喜勿喷 &lt;br&gt;  &lt;img src=&quot;https://bucket-api.fengimg.com/feng-bbs-att/2025/02/13/085804tk7e9l2u2m99dkkm.JPG&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;  &lt;img src=&quot;https://bucket-api.fengimg.com/feng-bbs-att/2025/02/13/085813hctw57heuljxpwew.JPG&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;  </description><link>https://www.feng.com/post/13881370</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.feng.com/post/13881370</guid><pubDate>Thu, 13 Feb 2025 00:58:17 GMT</pubDate><author>shuanghui888</author></item><item><title>XR ios14.6 隐藏id</title><description>某鱼买了台XR给小孩（高中生）用，原主人是老人，家人帮忙设置ID后时间久了忘记密码，现在手机是能用就是下载软件比较麻烦，网上搜索一圈发现删除手机三个文件可以达到隐藏ID，可视频博主没说是哪几个，所以麻烦有知道的大神告诉一声，万分感谢！手机现在是14.6系统，已经装了巨魔！</description><link>https://www.feng.com/post/13880288</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.feng.com/post/13880288</guid><pubDate>Thu, 06 Feb 2025 07:04:00 GMT</pubDate><author>ch_wt</author></item><item><title>xr13.6系统特别卡是什么原因</title><description>&lt;p&gt;媳妇退下来的xr一直没升系统，我拿来当备用机了，为啥特别卡，也抹除恢复出厂设置了，还是卡，好多年没研究了，现在还能平刷么？或者有什么办法恢复成新机性能&lt;/p&gt;</description><link>https://www.feng.com/post/13879816</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.feng.com/post/13879816</guid><pubDate>Mon, 03 Feb 2025 05:24:09 GMT</pubDate><author>祖国花儿</author></item><item><title>XR广电ipcc求分享</title><description>&lt;p&gt;求个XR的广电IPCC   所有版本！求分享一下&lt;/p&gt;</description><link>https://www.feng.com/post/13875565</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.feng.com/post/13875565</guid><pubDate>Mon, 06 Jan 2025 03:38:37 GMT</pubDate><author>WK13521</author></item><item><title>24w充电 正常吗？</title><description>&lt;br&gt;  &lt;img src=&quot;https://bucket-api.fengimg.com/feng-bbs-att/2025/01/04/1036429kqkbcoii8xtjv6u.jpeg&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;  &lt;img src=&quot;https://bucket-api.fengimg.com/feng-bbs-att/2025/01/04/103642lerav5e37tcawsym.jpeg&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;  </description><link>https://www.feng.com/post/13875167</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.feng.com/post/13875167</guid><pubDate>Sat, 04 Jan 2025 02:36:50 GMT</pubDate><author>zsksssss</author></item><item><title>巨魔刷机</title><description>&lt;p&gt;巨魔14.4.2更新18巨魔还在吗&lt;/p&gt;</description><link>https://www.feng.com/post/13874593</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.feng.com/post/13874593</guid><pubDate>Tue, 31 Dec 2024 12:59:06 GMT</pubDate><author>心想是鸳鸯仙</author></item><item><title>14.4，关于越狱巨魔问题请教。</title><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;请问各位封釉，系统&lt;/strong&gt;14.4&lt;strong&gt;，是用牛磺酸越狱更好吗？巨魔是装巨魔&lt;/strong&gt;2&lt;strong&gt;还是巨魔&lt;/strong&gt;x&lt;strong&gt;？哪个更好。&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description><link>https://www.feng.com/post/13872933</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.feng.com/post/13872933</guid><pubDate>Sat, 21 Dec 2024 06:52:43 GMT</pubDate><author>情商低于0</author></item><item><title>真流畅</title><description>&lt;p&gt;好流畅&lt;/p&gt; &lt;br&gt;  &lt;img src=&quot;https://bucket-api.fengimg.com/feng-bbs-att/2024/12/04/1927560mndgugykv8rxlnp.jpeg&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;  </description><link>https://www.feng.com/post/13870055</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.feng.com/post/13870055</guid><pubDate>Wed, 04 Dec 2024 11:27:58 GMT</pubDate><author>yangyiyiyiyi</author></item><item><title>这个系统能不能等巨魔，越狱</title><description>&lt;img src=&quot;https://www.feng.com/_nuxt/img/yishanchu.368ead2.png&quot; alt=&quot;威锋&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;div align=&quot;center&quot;&gt;帖子已被删除&lt;/div&gt;</description><link>https://www.feng.com/post/13870047</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.feng.com/post/13870047</guid><pubDate>Wed, 04 Dec 2024 10:07:16 GMT</pubDate><author>已注销用户19310078</author></item><item><title>XR目前停留在12.3版本，很多软件用不了，有必要升下系统吗？能升哪个版本？</title><description>😀</description><link>https://www.feng.com/post/13869401</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.feng.com/post/13869401</guid><pubDate>Sat, 30 Nov 2024 16:45:19 GMT</pubDate><author>raotian6</author></item><item><title>电池值不值得换一下子，续航半天</title><description>&lt;br&gt;  &lt;img src=&quot;https://bucket-api.fengimg.com/feng-bbs-att/2024/11/19/125311sxeydmzf7vwy8nky.jpeg&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;  </description><link>https://www.feng.com/post/13867235</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.feng.com/post/13867235</guid><pubDate>Tue, 19 Nov 2024 04:53:43 GMT</pubDate><author>gjw2011</author></item><item><title>我来询价的</title><description>&lt;p&gt;好久没来论坛了，XR不知不觉用了5年，目前14.3的系统还很流畅，在天才吧换了一次电池现在容量还有82%，黄色64G全原，没有磕碰还能卖多少钱？想卖转转回收报价900会被砍多少？本地商家太黑报400-700。&lt;/p&gt;</description><link>https://www.feng.com/post/13864315</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.feng.com/post/13864315</guid><pubDate>Tue, 05 Nov 2024 00:59:04 GMT</pubDate><author>yangyunju</author></item><item><title>ipcc 60.0 提取于18.1rc</title><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.123684.com/s/CKCtVv-FCpw3?%E6%8F%90%E5%8F%96%E7%A0%81:gzZ8&quot;&gt;【链接】&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description><link>https://www.feng.com/post/13862264</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.feng.com/post/13862264</guid><pubDate>Sun, 27 Oct 2024 09:18:23 GMT</pubDate><author>萝卜肉骨头</author></item><item><title>今天把iPhoneXR从15.7.1系统直接升级到了17.7系统。</title><description>全原，电池81%，升级之后体验完美。</description><link>https://www.feng.com/post/13860593</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.feng.com/post/13860593</guid><pubDate>Sun, 20 Oct 2024 06:53:17 GMT</pubDate><author>ylh1144</author></item><item><title>ios14.2taruine越狱后无限重启了</title><description>ios14.2taruine越狱后突然安全模式，在然后就无限重启了，还有救吗，只能升级了吗</description><link>https://www.feng.com/post/13858366</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.feng.com/post/13858366</guid><pubDate>Fri, 11 Oct 2024 14:08:34 GMT</pubDate><author>其实不想留</author></item><item><title>已与物主锁定！求助</title><description>&lt;p&gt;      前段时间，莫名其妙在自己家里捡到一把xr，第一时间想到的，肯定是来过自己家里的人落下的，有来过的、能想到的，电话一个个问……结果居然都不是……而且该手机也没插电话卡（没的联系了），于是也就这样一直搁置着，兴许有人来家里问吧！&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;       这次国庆回来，发现还是没有人来领……算了，我自己拿去刷机得了，自己使用吧！结果，现在已经如标题所说……锁定了！哎，除了官解之外，其他的能试的都试了！无解啊，想问问各位兄弟，还有什么其他的办法么？不然这样放着……怪可惜的，主要是浪费，毕竟硬件都没坏&lt;/p&gt; &lt;br&gt;  &lt;img src=&quot;https://bucket-api.fengimg.com/feng-bbs-att/2024/10/03/153620aj32fohfz4y94w09.jpeg&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;  </description><link>https://www.feng.com/post/13856175</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.feng.com/post/13856175</guid><pubDate>Thu, 03 Oct 2024 07:37:32 GMT</pubDate><author>凌潇JUG</author></item><item><title>音量键加为什么突然失灵了 没摔过没进水</title><description>&lt;p&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><link>https://www.feng.com/post/13855360</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.feng.com/post/13855360</guid><pubDate>Sun, 29 Sep 2024 07:34:42 GMT</pubDate><author>sherlyw456</author></item><item><title>最新系统，就是锁屏时打开相机有些慢，还好</title><description>&lt;p&gt;现在打开手机相机拍照，￼有时候有些慢，￼显得卡顿。 ￼微信速度普通可以接受， ￼不是很觉得。￼其他有些app￼确实比新的手机慢，￼但可以接受。￼￼为什么仍然xr，￼为了lcd屏幕，￼不盲眼。&lt;/p&gt;</description><link>https://www.feng.com/post/13854100</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.feng.com/post/13854100</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Sep 2024 00:18:58 GMT</pubDate><author>微笑smile</author></item><item><title>各位朋友都用的什么膜</title><description>&lt;img src=&quot;https://www.feng.com/_nuxt/img/yishanchu.368ead2.png&quot; alt=&quot;威锋&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;div align=&quot;center&quot;&gt;帖子已被删除&lt;/div&gt;</description><link>https://www.feng.com/post/13852372</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.feng.com/post/13852372</guid><pubDate>Fri, 20 Sep 2024 08:51:56 GMT</pubDate><author>浪子龙三</author></item><item><title>简单点，直接ios18</title><description>&lt;p&gt;换了电池，直接上18，XR还能继续&lt;/p&gt; &lt;br&gt;  &lt;img src=&quot;https://bucket-api.fengimg.com/feng-bbs-att/2024/09/17/014637twvgtgm9bft5u3mh.jpeg&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;  &lt;img src=&quot;https://bucket-api.fengimg.com/feng-bbs-att/2024/09/17/014636n63s3764tm4yhcet.jpeg&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;  &lt;img src=&quot;https://bucket-api.fengimg.com/feng-bbs-att/2024/09/17/014637sl6sby8i2bzea7yr.jpeg&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;  &lt;img src=&quot;https://bucket-api.fengimg.com/feng-